OL,3,AFunding shortages force World Food
OL,4,AProgramme to cut aid to Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the main suppliers of food aid
OL,7,Fto the Gaza Strip, the World Food
OL,8,FProgramme (WFP), says that it is being
OL,9,Fforced to "drastically reduce
OL,10,Flifesaving assistance" to the
OL,11,FPalestinian territory due to funding
OL,12,Fshortages.
OL,14,FOverall, the number of people helped by
OL,15,Fthe UN agency will drop by about a
OL,16,Fthird - from 1.6 million to 1.1
OL,17,Fmillion.
OL,19,FThe cuts will hit as winter approaches
OL,20,Fand at a time when many families in
OL,21,FGaza are still struggling to feed
OL,22,Fthemselves.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
