OL,3,AFunding shortages force World Food
OL,4,AProgramme to cut aid to Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne effect is that the number of hot
OL,7,Fmeals that are currently being provided
OL,8,Fby community kitchens will be cut from
OL,9,F250,000 to 150,000 each day.
